      "rationale": {
        "for": "A wedding, festive or milestone buyer who is shopping for a moment rather than a single item.",
        "whyThisBusiness": "The catalogue's own photography is the strongest asset and the site publishes no occasion copy, so this concept supplies the occasion frame in structure and rhythm while leaving every product claim to the catalogue.",
        "tradeOff": "The most decorative of the three; the least efficient for a buyer who already knows the exact piece."
      },
